{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>For a fire went forth from Heshbon.</b> This means: the people of Heshbon rebelled against the king of Moab, their king." "<b>A flame.</b> From the city of Sihon — from the town that now belongs to Sihon." "<b>Down to Arnon's heights.</b> A term for plain/level ground, like מבעלי יהודה — meaning, all around those heights was level ground."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:19:07.580319548Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}